<title>DUBAI: UK vessel to call on Saudi port of Jubail.</title>
<headline>UK vessel to call on Saudi port of Jubail.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-11-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British aircraft carrier HMS Invincible will call on the Saudi Arabian port of Jubail on November 17, Saudi newspapers said on Saturday.</p>
<p>The dailies, quoting a British embassy statement, said the vessel is touring the Gulf Arab region to conduct a series of training exercises with allied navies in the area, including the U.S.</p>
<p>It has visited several United Arab Emirates ports and will go to Kuwait before heading for Jubail.</p>
</text>
